:"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1445,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"一字百题示商君祥 其七十三 行","author":"李俊民","text":"水笑杯犹渡，山惊锡尚飞。\n垂垂瓶钵老，何处未来归。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1446,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"一字百题示商君祥 其七十四 住","author":"李俊民","text":"俗尚家灵运，谁堪社远公。\n空山云不出，愁杀渡溪风。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1447,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"一字百题示商君祥 其七十五 坐","author":"李俊民","text":"一轩容膝安，半世行脚债。\n庞家老居士，举似无生话。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1448,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"一字百题示商君祥 其七十六 卧","author":"李俊民","text":"一室散天花，一榻飏茶烟。\n家风嗣阿谁，残月晓风禅。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1449,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"一字百题示商君祥 其七十七 笑","author":"李俊民","text":"和气须欢伯，开颜只孔方。\n世情如苦海，件件可鬨堂。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1450,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"一字百题示商君祥 其七十八 吟","author":"李俊民","text":"冥搜肠亦苦，只字得之难。\n作者有六义，惜哉坐一寒。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1451,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"一字百题示商君祥 其七十九 醉","author":"李俊民","text":"爱此真珠滴，能于大道通。\n与君同举白，怜我独潮红。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1452,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"一字百题示商君祥 其八十 醒","author":"李俊民","text":"暂出陶陶境，那禁种种愁。\n举觞邀明月，却带醉乡侯。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1453,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"一字百题示商君祥 其八十一 饮","author":"李俊民","text":"竹叶杯中醁，金钗坐上春。\n浅斟低唱境，犹道是粗人。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1454,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"一字百题示商君祥 其八十二 舞","author":"李俊民","text":"野鹤闻琴态，孤鸾对镜妍。\n为君小垂手，无地可回旋。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1455,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"一字百题示商君祥 其八十三 睡","author":"李俊民","text":"客随陶令遣，斋甚太常严。\n傥或非黄奶，那知此黑甜。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1456,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"一字百题示商君祥 其八十四 梦","author":"李俊民","text":"物外日月忙，人閒忧患长。\n休谈梦中梦，万古一黄粱。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1457,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"一字百题示商君祥 其八十五 歌","author":"李俊民","text":"大音声自希，赏音人亦寡。\n宁可逆汝耳，不可废作者。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1458,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"一字百题示商君祥 其八十六 啸","author":"李俊民","text":"成瑨风生坐，孙登月满台。\n东皋今寂寞，元亮早归来。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1459,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"一字百题示商君祥 其八十七 傲","author":"李俊民","text":"王公轻以道，富贵骄以志。\n我见高尚人，盖有高尚事。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1460,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"一字百题示商君祥 其八十八 闲","author":"李俊民","text":"太傅悬车里，仙家避世壶。\n老妻为纸局，坐隐是功夫。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1461,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"一字百题示商君祥 其八十九 懒","author":"李俊民","text":"交有书堪绝，师何记可嘲。\n不僧亦不俗，似痴还似高。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1462,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"一字百题示商君祥 其九十 话","author":"李俊民","text":"万事就庾谈，一心对芝宇。\n不思炊作麋，但见风生麈。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1463,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"一字百题示商君祥 其九十一 浴","author":"李俊民","text":"子春恐事败，佟之坐水淫。\n二者过不及，何如我洗心。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1464,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"一字百题示商君祥 其九十二 归","author":"李俊民","text":"世路虽多梗，吾生岂系匏。\n西风倦飞翼，乐在一枝巢。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1465,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"一字百题示商君祥 其九十三 别","author":"李俊民","text":"更尽一杯酒，出门行路难。\n送君过南浦，忍泪凭栏干。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1466,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"一字百题示商君祥 其九十四 愁","author":"李俊民","text":"解使回肠断，能催两鬓秋。\n天涯未归客，容易上眉头。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1467,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"一字百题示商君祥 其九十五 忍","author":"李俊民","text":"气留脐可煖，唾使面自乾。\n无怨亦无恶，此腹如此宽。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1468,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"一字百题示商君祥 其九十六 蚕","author":"李俊民","text":"蚕月始条桑，悤悤妇姑忙。\n天寒授衣节，妇姑无完裳。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1469,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"一字百题示商君祥 其九十七 织","author":"李俊民","text":"泛槎惊误客，折齿笑狂邻。\n不作回文字，愁嫌愁杀人。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1470,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"一字百题示商君祥 其九十八 舂","author":"李俊民","text":"断木才脱粟，湿薪空爆竹。\n朝餐动及午，柰此雷鸣腹。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1471,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"一字百题示商君祥 其九十九 炊","author":"李俊民","text":"旅食寄天涯，愁如桂玉何。\n莫忘生处乐，听取扊扅歌。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1472,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"一字百题示商君祥 其一○○ 砧","author":"李俊民","text":"对影无情石，关心寄远衣。\n天涯镇长客，雁后不怀归。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1473,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"和筹堂四首 其一 琴","author":"李俊民","text":"山水有清音，琅然出枯木。\n若教俗耳听，丝竹不如肉。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1474,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"和筹堂四首 其二 棋","author":"李俊民","text":"森森戈戟心，尽在皮里著。\n傍有烂柯人，点破都是错。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1475,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"和筹堂四首 其三 书","author":"李俊民","text":"一坑科斗灰，难破祖龙惑。\n三两挟策人，今谁席肯侧。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1476,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"和筹堂四首 其四 画","author":"李俊民","text":"手与心相应，妙处在咫尺。\n笔尖多少锋，挥埽天地窄。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1477,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"东郊行","author":"李俊民","text":"四海尚干戈，几人知稼穑。\n青青原上麦，忍放征马食。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1478,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"书壁","author":"李俊民","text":"世事纷纷变，人生种种愁。\n行年三十九，得岁又平头。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1479,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"避乱","author":"李俊民","text":"雪岩依日煖，霜树弄风悲。\n山似王维画，人如杜甫诗。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1480,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"资圣寺壁","author":"李俊民","text":"是谁将壁疥，尽可著纱笼。\n今代无诗史，何时入国风。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1481,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"别陈之纲李得之南子荣","author":"李俊民","text":"已兆池鱼祸，尚多风鹢过。\n寄与远游人，莫待赆行货。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1482,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"戏高广之","author":"李俊民","text":"一饮遇伶妇，一饭值丘嫂。\n徒教乞米僧，时时送卢老。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1483,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"雨后","author":"李俊民","text":"新秋积雨霁，凉风吹我衣。\n岁月不知老，乾坤何处归。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1484,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"九日答朱寿之","author":"李俊民","text":"与客登高处，节物伤迟暮。\n不见白衣来，三复秋风句。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1485,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"竹林","author":"李俊民","text":"初见锦绷脱，气已傲霜雪。\n天寒十万夫，未闻一死节。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1486,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"柏径","author":"李俊民","text":"岁晚节自抱，足见有心哉。\n游人从何处，带得春风来。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1487,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"槐亭","author":"李俊民","text":"蚁穴功名重，或作封侯梦。\n主人心已闲，不为黄花动。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1488,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"稻塍","author":"李俊民","text":"一水自纵横，厥田无上下。\n居民不佩犊，岁事在秧马。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1489,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"儒","author":"李俊民","text":"世治其术重，世乱其术轻。\n太平然后用，用然后太平。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1490,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"蝶","author":"李俊民","text":"转首一场梦，惊心三月春。\n扬扬枝上蝶，不见惜花人。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1491,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"熊白","author":"李俊民","text":"所居无禹庙，有官升典签。\n掌亦我所欲，二者不可兼。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1492,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"十六日夜戏书","author":"李俊民","text":"贪作梅花梦，都忘柳絮禅。\n可怜人与月，不似夜来圆。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1493,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"雪庵题钱过庭梅花图","author":"李俊民","text":"已把传神画谱，又看格在诗评。\n月落难寻清梦，云空乃见高情。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1494,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"示侄辈","author":"李俊民","text":"诸阮以富相誇，二疏恐财为病。\n济叔不羡金埒，绩兄曾有挝命。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1495,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"渊明归去来图","author":"李俊民","text":"先生从来寄傲，肯向小儿鞠躬。\n笑指田园归去，门前五柳春风。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1496,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"中秋","author":"李俊民","text":"三百六旬岁周，一十二度月圆。\n试问姮娥甲子，和闰到今几年。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1497,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}}]